).\n\nKey consideration: The interest explicitly says NOT interested in 餐饮门店经营 (restaurant operations) or 厨电促销 (kitchen appliance promotions). The \"市场观察\" content type explicitly covers \"连锁餐饮门店选址、加盟合同和外卖促销，并展示厨电套餐的折扣规则与销售话术\" — this is exactly what the user does NOT want.\n\nAlso, \"专题观察\" content type covers \"地方饮食的历史、节庆习俗和餐桌礼仪，记录菜名的演变与民间故事\" — this is about food culture/history, which is somewhat tangential to the user's interest in reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. It's not directly aligned with the core interest.\n\nThe user's interest is: 可复现做法 (reproducible methods), 食材处理 (ingredient handling), 烹饪原理 (cooking principles).\n\nSo the most relevant content types are:\n- 操作记录 (operation records - reproducible methods, ingredient amounts, processing order, heating, adjustments) — highly relevant\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles - explains how moisture, temperature, structure affect texture) — highly relevant (cooking principles)\n- 概念速览 (concept overview - lists common concepts, provides question catalog) — moderately relevant\n\nThe least relevant:\n- 市场观察 (market observation - restaurant operations, kitchen appliance promotions) — explicitly excluded\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation - food history, customs, table etiquette, dish name evolution, folk stories) — not aligned with reproducible methods/principles\n\nLet me select 20 candidates that are relevant. I should avoid 市场观察 entirely (explicitly excluded by user interest). I should prefer 操作记录, 条件与原理, and 概念速览.\n\nLet me count available candidates by type. Given the working set has 120 candidates, I need to pick 20. Let me focus on the most relevant content types.\n\nLet me identify candidates that are 操作记录 (operation records) and 条件与原理 (conditions/principles) and 概念速览 (concept overviews), avoiding 市场观察 and 专题观察.\n\nLet me scan through the candidates list for the relevant types. Given the large number, let me select a balanced set across topics and contexts.\n\nLet me iden