豆腐：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n\n煎饺:\n- item-3302498cd23d 煎饺：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-76a48bfcc5ba 煎饺：小份试做中的操作记录\n\n米饭含水量:\n- item-7caafc64af77 米饭含水量：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n- item-41f1925e3d74 米饭含水量：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n\n清汤调味:\n- item-634a3326befd 清汤调味：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-693e18a58e5e 清汤调味：小份试做中的操作记录\n\n蒸鱼:\n- item-6ea61df40864 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-7e57e95a49ff 蒸鱼：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n\n番茄炒蛋:\n- item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的条件与原理\n- item-47ec3b435037 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的操作记录\n\n鸡胸肉口感:\n- item-0ef03b868945 鸡胸肉口感：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-793b229f835d 鸡胸肉口感：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n\n面团发酵:\n- item-2bd3f1c7d71a 面团发酵：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理\n- item-58677ff38120 面团发酵：小份试做中的操作记录\n\n炖牛肉:\n- item-342993e68175 炖牛肉：工作日备餐中的操作记录\n- item-7bd0e2754de2 炖牛肉：小份试做中的操作记录\n\n蔬菜焯水:\n- item-1f7a4e5259fb 蔬菜焯水：小份试做中的条件与原理\n- item-52c20cae5610 蔬菜焯水：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录\n\nThat's 22. I need exactly 20. Let me trim to 20 while keeping balance across topics and content types.\n\nLet me reconsider. I want a good balance. Let me pick 2 per topic = 20 exactly.\n\n煎豆腐: item-0714769b6401 (条件与原理), item-085ac75e2f6f (操作记录)\n煎饺: item-3302498cd23d (条件与原理), item-76a48bfcc5ba (操作记录)\n米饭含水量: item-7caafc64af77 (条件与原理), item-41f1925e3d74 (操作记录)\n清汤调味: item-634a3326befd (条件与原理), item-693e18a58e5e (操作记录)\n蒸鱼: item-6ea61df40864 (条件与原理), item-7e57e95a49ff (操作记录)\n番茄炒蛋: item-20d117d62c34 (条件与原理), item-47ec3b435037 (操作记录)\n鸡胸肉口感: item-0ef03b868945 (条件与原理), item-793b229f835d (操作记录)\n面团发酵: item-2bd3f1c7d71a (条件与原理), item-58677ff38120 (操作记录)\n炖牛肉: item-342993e68175 (操作记录), item-7bd0e2754de2 (操作记录)\n蔬菜焯水: item-1f7a4e5259fb (条件与原理), item-52c20cae5610 (操作记录)\n\nThat's 20 candidates, covering all 10 topics, with a good mix of 条件与原理 (cooking principles) and 操作记录 (reproducible methods). This aligns well with the user's interest in reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles.\n\nWait, for 炖牛肉 I have two 操作记录 and no 条件与原理. Let me check if there's a 炖牛肉 条件与原理. Looking at the list... I don't see a 炖牛肉 条件与原理 in the candidates. Let me check. The 炖牛肉 candidates I saw: 概念速览 (18577284501f, 2fd42153e999, 365b6f2cee06), 专题观察 (2f213d3b669b), 市场观察 (70b674d04c61, 76364842ad65, 90c6df0a70a3), 操作记录 (342993e68175, 7bd0e2754de2). So no 条件与原理 for 炖牛肉. That's fine, two 操作记录 works.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether to include some 概念速览 for variety. The user's interest is about reproducible methods and principles. 操作记录 and 条件与原理 are the most directly aligned. I'll keep my selection focused on these two types which best serve the user's stated interest.\n\nLet me verify each candidate ID exists in the list. All the ones I selected appear in the candidates list. Good.\n\nLet me now write recommendation reasons grounded in the facts for each.\n\nLet me create the plan and publish.\n\nLet me draft reasons for each:\n\n1. item-0714769b6401 煎豆腐：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 - Explains how moisture, temperature, and ingredient structure affect texture of pan-fried tofu, directly serving the user's interest in cooking principles and ingredient handling.\n\n2. item-085ac75e2f6f 煎豆腐：家庭周末午餐中的操作记录 - Provides reproducible ingredient amounts, processing order, heating intensity/time, and adjustment steps for pan-fried tofu, matching the user's interest in reproducible methods.\n\n3. item-3302498cd23d 煎饺：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 - Explains conditions/principles behind pan-fried dumpling texture.\n\n4. item-76a48bfcc5ba 煎饺：小份试做中的操作记录 - Reproducible operation record for pan-fried dumplings with adjustment steps for over-dry/undercooked issues.\n\n5. item-7caafc64af77 米饭含水量：家庭周末午餐中的条件与原理 - Cooking principles for rice water content.\n\n6. item-41f1925e3d74 米饭含水量：工作日备餐中的操作记录 - Reproducible method for rice water content.\n\n7. item-634a3326befd 清汤调味：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 - Cooking principles for clear soup seasoning.\n\n8. item-693e18a58e5e 清汤调味：小份试做中的操作记录 - Reproducible seasoning method.\n\n9. item-6ea61df40864 蒸鱼：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 - Steamed fish cooking principles.\n\n10. item-7e57e95a49ff 蒸鱼：工作日备餐中的操作记录 - Reproducible steamed fish method.\n\n11. item-20d117d62c34 番茄炒蛋：两人晚餐中的条件与原理 - Tomato